NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/channelgateway.ConvertImage kind=func
  digest=b3:b42349623c42668d358c6143ed8f9844647b9d2e75e30f197cddec928643bc18 file=neo/internal/channelgateway/media.go range=32:86 lang=go exported=true byte_range=475:3367
  sig=func ConvertImage(reader io.Reader, policy ImagePolicy) (ConvertedImage, error)
  doc=ConvertImage performs bounded, deterministic server-side conversion for\nchannels with stricter media limits. It decodes real JPEG/PNG input, scales\nto the channel dimensions, and lowers JPEG quality until the byte ceiling is\nmet. Audio/video are passed only when already within adapter limits; their\ncodecs are deliberately adapter-owned rather than guessed here.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/channelgateway/media.go

